From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marco <falco@localhost>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:04:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(audio): capture only applications visible on the
 streamed display

Adds audio_capture = onscreen (Windows): per-process loopback of the process
trees owning a visible window on the streamed display, mixed at frame rate.
Voice chat apps (Discord, TeamSpeak, ...) and audio_exclude_apps are never
captured; the default sink is left untouched so the host keeps its audio.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
